ole":"被获","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o024a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0010","role":"被获","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o024a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":214,"label":"建安十九年取皖时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhouyu-y214","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhouyu-q-o055","basis":"建安十九年取皖时"},"evidence":["zhouyu-e-o078b-q","zhouyu-q-o055","zhouyu-q-b-0b97839bb010b95d03d3"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o078b-q","source_order":[54,364,"O078b"],"order":9704},{"id":"chenghuang-e-o106","title":"宁从攻皖为升城督破获朱光拜折冲","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-d377e25c8cb88184effc","label":"正文","text":"宁从攻皖为升城督破获朱光拜折冲","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"]}],"participants":[{"person":"gan-ning","role":"为升城督、手持练身缘城为吏士先、卒破获朱光、计功次之拜折冲将军","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"]},{"person":"lu-meng","role":"计功为最","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0050","role":"被破获者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41","source_order":[55,229,26],"order":9877}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0050","name":"朱光","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o077","wuzhu-q-o024","chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o077-zhouyu-p0050","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o077"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o024-zhouyu-p0050","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o024"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o038-zhouyu-p0050","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o038"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-7f8f113d07eec7630d41","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-c0a5ed98d6df9e7db901","layer":"original","quote":"后从攻皖，为升城督〖6〗。宁手持练〖7〗，身缘城，为吏士先，卒破获朱光。计功，吕蒙为最；宁次之，拜折冲将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":79},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o024a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-07d31f801d4d8fc6e176","layer":"original","quote":"十九年五月〖10〗，权征皖城。闰月〖11〗，克之，获庐江太守朱光及参军董和〖12〗，男女数万口。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o038b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8b56f94fb6258cb05737","layer":"original","quote":"权遣校尉梁寓，奉贡于汉；及令王惇市马〖25〗；又遣朱光等归。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":61},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-07d31f801d4d8fc6e176","layer":"original","quote":"十九年五月〖10〗，权征皖城。闰月〖11〗，克之，获庐江太守朱光及参军董和〖12〗，男女数万口。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o038","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8b56f94fb6258cb05737","layer":"original","quote":"曹公表权为骠骑将军〖23〗，假节〖24〗，领荆州牧，封南昌侯。权遣校尉梁寓，奉贡于汉；及令王惇市马〖25〗；又遣朱光等归。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o077a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-4213c485decada1a3cff","layer":"original","quote":"曹公遣朱光为庐江太守，屯皖，大开稻田；又令间人招诱鄱阳贼帅〖1〗，使作内应。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o078b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3459487c408e16051599","layer":"original","quote":"蒙以精锐继之。侵晨进攻〖4〗，蒙手执桴鼓〖5〗；士卒皆腾踊自升，食时破之〖6〗。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":78},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-0b97839bb010b95d03d3","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0b97839bb010b95d03d3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":273,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b36934799625fd06a68a","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o055","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c8a07d2cedd1418bd183","layer":"original","quote":"十九年〖10〗，从权破皖城，转横江将军。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o077","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-4213c485decada1a3cff","layer":"original","quote":"曹公遣朱光为庐江太守，屯皖，大开稻田；又令间人招诱鄱阳贼帅〖1〗，使作内应。蒙曰：“皖田肥美，若一收熟，彼众必增；如是数岁，操态现矣〖2〗：宜早除之！”乃具陈其状。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
